{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">支聯會煽動顛覆國家政權案，今早在西九龍裁判法院作出裁決。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.C.ALLIANCE.OUTSIDE-0800.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20261hl6hmYhnH1787272329.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.C.ALLIANCE.OUTSIDE-0800.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方部署大批警力，在法院外圍巡邏。昨日傍晚已有市民到法院輪候聽審。案件由三名國安法指定法官李運騰、陳仲衡及黎婉姬共同審理，預計裁決需時一小時。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.C.ALLIANCE.OUTSIDE-0800_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Mf9QBAoTIo1787272359.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.C.ALLIANCE.OUTSIDE-0800_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">已解散的支聯會，前正副主席李卓人、何俊仁及鄒幸彤被控煽動他人顛覆國家政權，其中何俊仁在開審前承認控罪。至於支聯會、李卓人及鄒幸彤，早前在高等法院否認控罪受審。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T00:59:47.362529+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}